5,1,1,talk,May,,I refuse to sign anything that leaves the burden on one gate forever.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We need to know what living beside this actually feels like daily.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Nobody has added up the costs yet. That worries me the most.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Midori,,We still have to live here together. Let's keep the peace.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I want to know the hours this takes out of us all.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, exactly. The budget gap is real.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, the daily grind is the real enemy here.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I agree. We need hard numbers before we guess.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Midori,,I worry about the silence between two houses right now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,Experience says the quiet ones wear people down the fastest.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,Let's look at the complaint log and the frontage measurements.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will check the station block's bin house and the minutes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll pull the block ledger and the ward subsidy details.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Midori,,I want to see the residents' meeting statements and the truck time.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will look into the supervised mornings and the filing requirements.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Fair enough. Let's see what the data says.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Facts will guide us better than feelings.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Sounds like a plan. I'll get to work.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,Thank you all. Let's hope it helps us talk again.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,A wise step. Let us see what the truth reveals.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
