35,2,1,talk,May,,Eleven complaints from one house. The imbalance is glaring.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The bin house smells worse than the open pile. That's a trap.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen a year in extra fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Midori,,The truck comes at seven forty. That's before most of us wake.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,A permanent build takes four months and five signatures. That is heavy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, those fees are just for open bags. We need structure.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Servas, four months is a long time to wait for a fix.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"The subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Midori,,"If the window starts too early, people will just ignore it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,The supervised mornings are only fifty minutes each. Manageable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,May,,The narrowest frontage is only ninety centimetres. We can't build there.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,The station block argued over sweeping within two years. We will too.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,So a permanent structure is expensive and slow.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Midori,,"Rotating the location might spread the pain, but also the responsibility.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,Rotating means new notices every time. That is administrative fatigue.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,May,,I think we need to look at the options now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. The data suggests the easy fixes are traps.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's see what the ward offers as actual choices.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Midori,,I hope one of them keeps us talking.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us see what remains on the table.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
