67,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"The subsidy helps with C, but the cost is still high.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Midori,,I worry B will make us the police. I don't want that.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,B relies on willpower. A relies on rules. Rules are safer.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,May,,I am leaning towards A. It's the only one that feels equal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. C is a disaster waiting to happen.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"A is expensive in admin, but fair. B is cheap but unfair.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
