74,3,3,talk,Servas,,A is the most sustainable. It prevents the quiet erosion of trust.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,May,,Let's vote. I think A is the clear winner.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let's not build a prison.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I'll vote A. Fairness matters more than saving a few yen.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Midori,,I vote A. I want us to be neighbours again.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,I vote A. It is the path of least resentment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
